sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform User
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as MCPServerReconciler<br/>(leader-elected)
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap/Secret<br/>(referenced resources)
    participant Pods as Managed Pods

    Note over User,Pods: MCPServer Creation / Update Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply MCPServer CR<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (For)<br/>ServiceAccount token auth

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get MCPServer spec
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: MCPServer details

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get referenced ConfigMaps<br/>(field-indexed lookup)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: ConfigMap data
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get referenced Secrets<br/>(field-indexed lookup)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Secret data

    Note over Controller: Compute config hash<br/>for rollout trigger

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>(apps/v1, owned)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Deployment status

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>(v1, owned)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Service status

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>(networking.k8s.io/v1, owned)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: NetworkPolicy status

    Controller->>K8sAPI: List Pods (label selector)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Pod statuses
    Note over Controller: Compute MCPServer<br/>status conditions from pods

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch MCPServer/status
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Status updated

    Note over User,Pods: ConfigMap/Secret Change Flow

    ConfigMap-->>K8sAPI: ConfigMap updated
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event<br/>(field-indexed map function)
    Note over Controller: findMCPServersForConfigMap<br/>triggers re-reconciliation
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Re-reconcile affected MCPServers

    Note over User,Pods: Metrics & Health Probes

    participant Monitor as Monitoring System
    Monitor->>Controller: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS + TokenReview/SAR auth
    Controller-->>Monitor: Prometheus metrics

    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    Kubelet->>Controller: GET :8081/healthz<br/>HTTP (unauthenticated)
    Controller-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>Controller: GET :8081/readyz<br/>HTTP (unauthenticated)
    Controller-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
